      <transcript>BØGEMNE-</transcript>
      <definition>[= bøgemle-] v . i. To gather together; to form into a lump, become lumpy, coagulate; to pile up.</definition>
      <page>124</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠪᠥᠺᠠᠮᠨᠠᠵᠤ ᠰᠠᠭᠤᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>--zy saγuxu, </transcript>
          <definition>To sit in a group; to live in a group</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
